(text "PI_HOLD (GPIO26): config.txt gpio=26=op,dh raises it ~1 s after power-up; dtoverlay=gpio-poweroff drops it once the Pi halts." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 115.57000000000001 208.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f4bb555e-36ea-49c5-b1ea-737cedbe1e65"))
(text "Key off: the Pi syncs and halts, SYS_EN decays under 1.13 V ~2 s later and the LM74800 cuts everything (3 uA standby)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 115.57000000000001 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c3766314-fc87-46aa-a7a9-d6abc708361c"))
(text "ACC alone holds SYS_EN ~5 s (100k x 47 uF) so a crank before the Pi boots doesn't drop power. BZT52C15 limits load dump on the cap." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 115.57000000000001 213.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a7c805ec-ff34-4246-bf4e-014d2d23474b"))
(text "Hung Pi: the BCM watchdog resets it, GPIO26 floats low (100k bleed), and the board powers off if the key is off." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 115.57000000000001 215.89999999999998 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a808c473-15fa-4d9c-b4ae-fb65fc28a96b"))
